n aim arrow on the grass at the batter's feet shows the direction live;","   - **shot** ✕/J/LMB (ground), **loft** □/K/RMB (in the air), **block** ○/L/Q (defend);","   - **special** △/I/F;","   - **charge** R2/E: before the ball pitches, step 24 units down the pitch. This turns a good length into a half-volley, but a miss off a spinner means a stumping chance."]}]}],"moreFiles":3,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174749__x8de669/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174752__xfb4127/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174755__x531263/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174758__x42640e/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174825__x17a627/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174825__x17a627/work/PLAN.md","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174834__x4394d1/agent.out","/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/agent.out"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NJL4sAc8h7fuqH9Hoaxzhc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
