the engine?\\n- What did you change in the engine, and why? (none if nothing)\\n- If you could change one thing about the engine, what would it be?\\n\\nPrompt Feedback \\n\\n- What did you like most about this prompt?\\n- What was confusing?\\n- What was the hardest thing to do?\\n- What would you change in this prompt?\",\"stderr\":\"\",\"interrupted\":false,\"isImage\":false,\"noOutputExpected\":false},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01K1CWEysGLuWmXQ76HThWbU\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174737__x193f88/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":2043,"oldLines":3,"newStart":2043,"newLines":6,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":600,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40\",\"uuid\":\"4bbfcec9-239c-4ce3-adea-ec1686a35550\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":700,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40\",\"uuid\":\"db89c9d4-a8a5-459b-a5e9-dc6c93b3d8d5\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":850,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40\",\"uuid\":\"c599ffc2-4133-465a-ba53-8eed5d278c7e\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":950,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40\",\"uuid\":\"86cf58bc-53e6-4cf6-9f61-37cb5236513a\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":1100,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146-4633-b27b-c7bc1bdf7a40\",\"uuid\":\"9a8531b5-9672-47ac-8442-22f87c7b3223\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":1250,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"041395ab-5146