\"lastCam\" 33-sim.js","description":"Remove Math.random reference and track last camera"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DxN8gihtAuHwkPHNrazER3","type":"tool_result","content":"00-core.js:2:// Every src file adds to globalThis.WP. The Sim (entities, rules) never touches the DOM, audio, rigs or Math.random.\n33-sim.js:1:// WP.Sim: one operation's run. Deterministic: fixed steps, seeded streams, no DOM, audio, rigs or Math.random.\n204:    this.lastCam = this.cam ? [this.cam.x, this.cam.y] : null;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"f8f8fd43-2d96-47fd-a041-cdb9e8857c66","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:44:35.053Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"00-core.js:2:// Every src file adds to globalThis.WP. The Sim (entities, rules) never touches the DOM, audio, rigs or Math.random.\n33-sim.js:1:// WP.Sim: one operation's run. Deterministic: fixed steps, seeded streams, no DOM, audio, rigs or Math.random.\n204:    this.lastCam = this.cam ? [this.cam.x, this.cam.y] : null;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"unavailable":true}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DxN8gihtAuHwkPHNrazER3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
