{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh4iFKxDj2ss5RqfxcZw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Next up is the renderer, with a fix to Mode7.view first: its cache keys on exact pitch, which the river bob changes every frame, so I'll round pitch to whole degrees and log that change.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9361,"cache_read_input_tokens":418298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9361},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"25716b3f-f91c-493c-83df-1b6c1378e9b6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:02:47.424Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh4iF6KBDf9WjtqVonra","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh4iFKxDj2ss5RqfxcZw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0167E3Lq8EhVxNeydZxBJBPr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    const q = Math.max(1 / 8, Math.round(k * 16) / 16), yaw = (Math.round((-this._a * 180 / Math.PI - 90) * 2) / 2) || 0, key = q + ':' + yaw + ':' + this._pd;\n    let v = this._views.get(key); if (!v) { if (this._views.size > 400) this._views.clear(); v = new E.View('mode7', 'Mode 7', yaw, this._pd, q, 1); this._views.set(key, v); }\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    const q = Math.max(1 / 8, Math.round(k * 16) / 16), yaw = (Math.round((-this._a * 180 / Math.PI - 90) * 2) / 2) || 0, pd = Math.round(this._pd), key = q + ':' + yaw + ':' + pd;   // (pitch in whole degrees: a bobbing camera reuses its views and the shape sprites cached on them)\n    let v = this._views.get(key); if (!v) { if (this._views.size > 400) this._views.clear(); v = new E.View('mode7', 'Mode 7', yaw, pd, q, 1); this._views.set(key, v); }\"\"\"\nn = s.count(old); assert n >= 1, n\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('replaced', n)\nEOF\ncat > engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, handoff copy) made for Operation Wolfpack\n\nEvery edit to `engine/my-3d2dge.js`, and why.\n\n1. **Mode 7 views reuse whole-degree pitches** (`Mode7.view`). The view a billboard is drawn with was keyed by the\n   camera's exact pitch, so a bobbing camera (the river op's boat) made a new `E.View` every frame, and every shape\n   sprite cached on a view was rebuilt every frame. The pitch is now rounded to whole degrees for the drawing view.\nEOF\ngrep -c \"pd = Math.round(this._pd)\" engine/my-3d2dge.js engine/modules/mode7.js","description":"Round Mode 7 view pitch in engine and log it"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9361,"cache_read_input_tokens":418298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9361},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"5d31b868-0cd7-476c-97dd-4e82d507e6df","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:02:53.116Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh4iF6KBDf9WjtqVonra","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0167E3Lq8EhVxNeydZxBJBPr":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    const q = Math.max(1 / 8, Math.round(k * 16) / 16), yaw = (Math.round((-this._a * 180 / Math.PI - 90) * 2) / 2) || 0, key = q + ':' + yaw + ':' + this._pd;\n    let v = this._views.get(key); if (!v) { if (this._views.size > 400) this._views.clear(); v = new E.View('mode7', 'Mode 7', yaw, this._pd, q, 1); this._views.set(key, v); }\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    const q = Math.max(1 / 8, Math.round(k * 16) / 16), yaw = (Math.round((-this._a * 180 / Math.PI - 90) * 2) / 2) || 0, pd = Math.round(this._pd), key = q + ':' + yaw + ':' + pd;   // (pitch in whole degrees: a bobbing camera reuses its views and the shape sprites cached on them)\n    let v = this._views.get(key); if (!v) { if (this._views.size > 400) this._views.clear(); v = new E.View('mode7', 'Mode 7', yaw, pd, q, 1); this._views.set(key, v); }\"\"\"\nn = s.count(old); assert n >= 1, n\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('replaced', n)\nEOF\ncat > engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, handoff copy) made for Operation Wolfpack\n\nEvery edit to `engine/my-3d2dge.js`, and why.\n\n1. **Mode 7 views reuse whole-degree pitches** (`Mode7.view`). The view a billboard is drawn with was keyed by the\n   camera's exact pitch, so a bobbing camera (the river op's boat) made a new `E.View` every frame, and every shape\n   sprite cached on a view was rebuilt every frame. The pitch is now rounded to whole degrees for the drawing view.\nEOF\ngrep -c \"pd = Math.round(this._pd)\" engine/my-3d2dge.js engine/modules/mode7.js","description":"Round Mode 7 view pitch in engine and log it"}}}
