{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh59eccUriKG2p7EieZe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018DYuvC8GspqMSNddj2ZKoS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), this._sfxBus, at, mul); }\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    let bus = this._sfxBus;\n    if (o.pan && this.ctx.createStereoPanner) { const pn = this.ctx.createStereoPanner(); pn.pan.value = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, o.pan)); pn.connect(this._sfxBus); bus = pn; setTimeout(() => { try { pn.disconnect(); } catch (e) { /* gone */ } }, 4000); }   // (stereo placement: o.pan -1 left .. 1 right)\n    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), bus, at, mul); }\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n2. **Stereo pan for sound effects** (`audio.sfx(voice, { pan: -1..1 })`). A `StereoPannerNode` per call between the\n   voices and the effects bus, so gunfire, rotors and explosions sit left or right of the screen. Without `pan` nothing\n   changes.\nEOF\necho done","description":"Add stereo pan to engine sfx and log it"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1238,"cache_read_input_tokens":470712,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1238},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"a7177be6-277b-44a6-9ac6-e012b01a2a91","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:08:22.172Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh59eMjzuVbtvA5c8gCg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_018DYuvC8GspqMSNddj2ZKoS":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), this._sfxBus, at, mul); }\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    let bus = this._sfxBus;\n    if (o.pan && this.ctx.createStereoPanner) { const pn = this.ctx.createStereoPanner(); pn.pan.value = Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, o.pan)); pn.connect(this._sfxBus); bus = pn; setTimeout(() => { try { pn.disconnect(); } catch (e) { /* gone */ } }, 4000); }   // (stereo placement: o.pan -1 left .. 1 right)\n    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), bus, at, mul); }\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n2. **Stereo pan for sound effects** (`audio.sfx(voice, { pan: -1..1 })`). A `StereoPannerNode` per call between the\n   voices and the effects bus, so gunfire, rotors and explosions sit left or right of the screen. Without `pan` nothing\n   changes.\nEOF\necho done","description":"Add stereo pan to engine sfx and log it"}}}
