{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh5U4z5kp1Cy31FjKZbZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm writing a scale-2 canvas menu, since `E.Menu` only draws at scale 1 and is too small for 10 feet, with the same repeat, hover and click handling. Engine changes to the Shell come first: a `rows` spec for custom settings screens, hidden setting groups, and PlayStation glyphs by default.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3076,"cache_read_input_tokens":500027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3076},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"5345b00e-0da0-4e8d-9a38-be05265f3037","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:12:23.543Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh5U4iCZfR6zbTnMwTes","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh5U4z5kp1Cy31FjKZbZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01L71ktua6X3xBjrK5ujqvYW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\n# 1. glyphs default playstation, options PS/Xbox only\nold=\"\"\"  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Auto'], ['xbox', 'Xbox'], ['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['nintendo', 'Nintendo'], ['generic', 'Positions']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; } },\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'playstation', options: [['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['xbox', 'Xbox']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; for (const q of g._players || []) q.glyphs = v; } },\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\n# 2. rows on any screen, and hidden groups in the standard Settings\nold=\"\"\"    if (name === 'settings') this._settingsRows(add);\n    if (name === 'controls') this._controls(add);\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    if (name === 'settings') this._settingsRows(add);\n    if (name === 'controls') this._controls(add);\n    if (s.rows) for (const [h, keys] of v(s.rows)) { if (h) add(this._el('div', 'esh-k esh-sec', h)); for (const k of keys) add(this._row(k)); }   // a screen of settings rows of the game's own (a dev screen)\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"\"\"    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g)));\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g) && !(Shell.hiddenGroups || []).includes(g)));\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^E.Shell = Shell\\|E.Shell = \" engine/my-3d2dge.js | head -3\ncat >> engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n3. **PlayStation glyphs by default** (the standard `glyphs` setting). The task designs for a DualSense first, with an\n   Xbox option: the setting now defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation and Xbox only, and applies to every\n   local player's input.\n4. **Settings rows on any Shell screen** (`shell.show(name, { rows: [[heading, [keys]]] })`). A screen of the game's own\n   can list settings rows (sliders, toggles, selects) drawn by the Shell's own `_row`, with pad, key and mouse focus: the\n   dev screen's live sliders are settings in a group of their own.\n5. **Hidden setting groups** (`E.Shell.hiddenGroups = ['Dev']`). The standard Settings screen skips those groups, so the\n   dev sliders live in `game.settings` (saved, checked, reset by `settings.reset('Dev')`) without crowding Settings.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Engine Shell edits: rows, hidden groups, glyph default"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3076,"cache_read_input_tokens":500027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3076},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"d31ee11e-397b-4f74-bab3-1c720f4e17a4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:12:32.036Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh5U4iCZfR6zbTnMwTes","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01L71ktua6X3xBjrK5ujqvYW":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\n# 1. glyphs default playstation, options PS/Xbox only\nold=\"\"\"  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Auto'], ['xbox', 'Xbox'], ['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['nintendo', 'Nintendo'], ['generic', 'Positions']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; } },\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'playstation', options: [['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['xbox', 'Xbox']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; for (const q of g._players || []) q.glyphs = v; } },\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\n# 2. rows on any screen, and hidden groups in the standard Settings\nold=\"\"\"    if (name === 'settings') this._settingsRows(add);\n    if (name === 'controls') this._controls(add);\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    if (name === 'settings') this._settingsRows(add);\n    if (name === 'controls') this._controls(add);\n    if (s.rows) for (const [h, keys] of v(s.rows)) { if (h) add(this._el('div', 'esh-k esh-sec', h)); for (const k of keys) add(this._row(k)); }   // a screen of settings rows of the game's own (a dev screen)\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold=\"\"\"    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g)));\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g) && !(Shell.hiddenGroups || []).includes(g)));\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^E.Shell = Shell\\|E.Shell = \" engine/my-3d2dge.js | head -3\ncat >> engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n3. **PlayStation glyphs by default** (the standard `glyphs` setting). The task designs for a DualSense first, with an\n   Xbox option: the setting now defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation and Xbox only, and applies to every\n   local player's input.\n4. **Settings rows on any Shell screen** (`shell.show(name, { rows: [[heading, [keys]]] })`). A screen of the game's own\n   can list settings rows (sliders, toggles, selects) drawn by the Shell's own `_row`, with pad, key and mouse focus: the\n   dev screen's live sliders are settings in a group of their own.\n5. **Hidden setting groups** (`E.Shell.hiddenGroups = ['Dev']`). The standard Settings screen skips those groups, so the\n   dev sliders live in `game.settings` (saved, checked, reset by `settings.reset('Dev')`) without crowding Settings.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Engine Shell edits: rows, hidden groups, glyph default"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L71ktua6X3xBjrK5ujqvYW","type":"tool_result","content":"9588:E.Shell = Shell;\nok","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a0704575-f16b-44ea-a24d-907e9c278025","uuid":"2bd50abc-07fc-46f0-8cec-820347245574","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:12:33.050Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"9588:E.Shell = Shell;\nok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183213__xf5fb84/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":754,"oldLines":3,"newStart":754,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01GZQkK34QTFRutfdybcnbpB\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183213__xf5fb84/work/TideCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183213/src/52-dev.js (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f\",\"uuid\":\"83531546-fcf7-4d91-935e-f53509827a20\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:12:27.367Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"type\":\"create\",\"filePath\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183213__xf5fb84/work/TideCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183213/src/52-dev.js\",\"content\":\"// 52-dev: dev mode, reached from the pause menu (not in AI Hub sessions). A canvas panel with six tabs generated from\\n// one descriptor list (a slider or toggle is one line: its path into tune, its range and step), the ACTIONS tab\\n// (restart, jump to any scene, kill all, spawn, weapons, lives, threats, clear, game over, the bot, a P2 bot, voice\\n// and music tests), RESET ALL TO DEFAULTS with a confirmation; changed values gold with the default in grey. The Sim\\n// is frozen while the panel is open. Hover focuses, a drag moves a knob, the wheel adjusts.\\n// Reads: tune and TUNE (00), the play scene's Session (60).\\n\\nconst DEVT = [\\n  ['PLAYER', [['God mode', 'player.god'], ['Infinite ammo', 'player.infAmmo'], ['Start lives', 'player.lives', 1, 9, 1], ['I-frames (s)', 'player.iframes', .5, 3, .1], ['Cover in (s)', 'player.coverIn', .05, .4, .01], ['Cover out (s)', 'player.coverOut', .05, .4, .01], ['Reload (s)', 'player.reload', .1, 1, .05], ['Pad aim speed', 'player.padSpeed', .5, 3, .1], ['Aim assist', 'player.assist', 0, 1, .05]]],\\n  ['WEAPONS', [['Handgun damage', 'weapon.hgDamage', .5, 3, .1], ['MG rate (/s)', 'weapon.mgRate', 4, 20, 1], ['MG damage', 'weapon.mgDamage', .1, 1, .05], ['Shotgun pellets', 'weapon.sgPellets', 4, 14, 1], ['Shotgun spread', 'weapon.sgSpread', 2, 12, .5], ['GL radius', 'weapon.glRadius', 24, 96, 4], ['GL damage', 'weapon.glDamage', 2, 12, .5], ['Ammo pickups ×', 'weapon.ammoMul', .5, 3, .1]]],\\n  ['ENEMIES', [['HP ×', 'enemy.hpMul', .5, 3, .1], ['Threat chance ×', 'enemy.threatMul', 0, 3, .1], ['Telegraph ×', 'enemy.teleMul', .5, 2, .05], ['Fire interval ×', 'enemy.fireMul', .5, 2, .05], ['Max threats (0 = stage)', 'enemy.maxThreats', 0, 4, 1], ['Minimum gap (s)', 'enemy.minGap', .1, 1, .05], ['Reaction delay ×', 'enemy.reactMul', .5, 2, .05], ['Boss HP ×', 'enemy.bossHpMul', .25, 3, .05]]],\\n  ['TIME', [['Freeze timer', 'time.freeze'], ['Scene time ×', 'time.sceneMul', .5, 2, .05], ['Elite bonus (s)', 'time.eliteBonus', 0, 5, .5], ['Refill after time-up', 'time.refill', .2, 1, .05], ['Game speed', 'time.speed', .25, 1.5, .05]]],\\n  ['VIEW', [['FOV', 'view.fov', 45, 75, 1], ['Show hit volumes', 'view.hitVolumes'], ['Colliders', 'view.colliders'], ['Rail and cover points', 'view.railPoints'], ['AI state labels', 'view.aiLabels'], ['Threat debug', 'view.threatDebug'], ['Perf overlay', 'view.perf'], ['Free camera', 'view.freeCam'], ['Hide HUD', 'view.hideHud']]],\\n  ['ACTIONS', null]\\n];\\nconst Dev = {\\n  isOpen: false, tab: 0, i: 0, confirm: false, play: null, msg: '', msgT: 0, jumpI: 0, spawnI: 0, rects: [], drag: null, free: null,\\n  open(play) { if (!play || play.s.hub) return; this.isOpen = true; this.play = play; this.i = 0; this.confirm = false; game.input.consumeAll(); },\\n  close() { this.isOpen = false; this.confirm = false; if (this.play) this.play.s.sim.cheats.god = !!tune.player.god; },\\n  items() {\\n    const t = DEVT[this.tab];\\n    if (t[1]) return t[1].map(([label, path, min, max, step]) => ({ label, path, min, max, step, kind: min === undefined ? 'toggle' : 'slider' })).concat([{ label: 'RESET ALL TO DEFAULTS', kind: 'reset' }]);\\n    const sim = this.play.s.sim, jumps = this.jumps(), spawns = all('enemy').filter(e => !e.board && e.ai !== 'turret').map(e => e.id);\\n    return [\\n      { label: 'Restart scene', kind: 'act', run: () => sim.jump(sim.stageId, sim.sceneId) },\\n      { label: 'Next scene', kind: 'act', run: () => { const sc = sim.stage.scenes, k = sim.sceneIdx; if (k + 1 < sc.length) sim.jump(sim.stageId, sc[k + 1]); else this.say('Last scene of the stage'); } },\\n      { label: 'Previous scene', kind: 'act', run: () => { const sc = sim.stage.scenes, k = sim.sceneIdx; if (k > 0) sim.jump(sim.stageId, sc[k - 1]); } },\\n      { label: 'Jump to: ' + jumps[this.jumpI % jumps.length].label, kind: 'pick', list: 'jump', run: () => jumps[this.jumpI % jumps.length].go() },\\n      { label: 'Kill all', kind: 'act', run: () => { for (const e of sim.enemies) if (!e.dead) TC.killEnemy(sim, e, { p: sim.players[0] }); } },\\n      { label: 'Spawn: ' + spawns[this.spawnI % spawns.length], kind: 'pick', list: 'spawn', run: () => { const id = spawns[this.spawnI % spawns.length], free = Object.keys(sim.covers).find(k => sim.covers[k].busy === 0) || Object.keys(sim.covers)[0]; if (id === 'drone') TC.makeEnemy(sim, 'drone', null, { at: vadd(sim.poseOf(0, 'stand') ? [sim.poseOf(0, 'stand').x + Math.cos(sim.poseOf(0, 'stand').yaw) * 160, sim.poseOf(0, 'stand').y + Math.sin(sim.poseOf(0, 'stand').yaw) * 160, sim.poseOf(0, 'stand').z + 20] : [0, 0, 40], [0, 0, 0]) }); else if (id === 'jetski' || id === 'runner') this.say('Spawned on its own path in its scenes'); else if (free) TC.makeEnemy(sim, id, free, { entry: 'stand' }); else { const c = sim.poseOf(0, 'stand'); TC.makeEnemy(sim, id, null, { at: [c.x + Math.cos(c.yaw) * 180, c.y + Math.sin(c.yaw) * 180, c.z - 24], entry: 'stand' }); } } },\\n      { label: 'All weapons and full ammo', kind: 'act', run: () => { for (const p of sim.players) for (const w of ['mg', 'sg', 'gl']) { p.owned[w] = true; p.ammo[w] = get('weapon', w).pool; } } },\\n      { label: '+1 life', kind: 'act', run: () => sim.players.forEach(p => p.lives++) },\\n      { label: 'Lose a life', kind: 'act', run: () => sim.hurt(sim.players[0], { ignoreI: true, reason: 'dev' }) },\\n      { label: 'Trigger a threat on me', kind: 'act', run: () => { const c = sim.poseOf(0, 'stand'); TC.requestThreat(sim, { src: 'dev', target: 0, dur: 1.2, kind: 'shot', at: [c.x + Math.cos(c.yaw) * 200, c.y + Math.sin(c.yaw) * 200, c.z], always: true }); } },\\n      { label: 'Clear stage', kind: 'act', run: () => { sim.phase = 'results'; sim.emit('stageclear', {}); } },\\n      { label: 'Game over', kind: 'act', run: () => { for (const p of sim.players) { p.lives = 0; p.out = true; p.cont = 0; } sim.phase = 'gameover'; } },\\n      { label: 'Bot plays (Autopilot): ' + (this.play.s.bots[0] ? 'ON' : 'OFF'), kind: 'act', run: () => { this.play.s.bots[0] = this.play.s.bots[0] ? null : new TC.Autopilot('expert'); } },\\n      { label: 'Add a P2 bot (split screen): ' + (sim.players.length > 1 ? 'ON' : 'OFF'), kind: 'act', run: () => this.p2bot() },\\n      { label: 'Voice test', kind: 'act', run: () => { const ids = ['kai', 'rook', 'mari', 'juno', 'hale', 'krake', 'barracuda', 'hammer']; ids.forEach((id, k) => game.after(k * 1.6, () => { TC.Voice.say(game, ['Copy that!', 'Kid, stay sharp.', 'Hang on tight!', 'Hostiles ahead!', 'Agents, report.', 'The sea takes all!', 'Too slow, CREST!', 'NOBODY PASSES.'][k], id); this.say(get('speaker', id).name); })); } },\\n      { label: 'Music test: ' + (this.songI === undefined ? 'next song' : all('song')[this.songI % all('song').length].id), kind: 'act', run: () => { this.songI = this.songI === undefined ? 0 : this.songI + 1; const s = all('song')[this.songI % all('song').length]; game.audio.music && game.audio.music(s, { fade: .3 }); this.play.s.music = s; this.say('Playing ' + s.id); } }\\n    ];\\n  },\\n  jumps() { const out = []; for (const st of all('stage')) for (const sc of st.scenes) out.push({ label: st.id + ' · ' + sc + ' ' + get('scene', sc).title, go: () => { const sim = this.play.s.sim; if (!sim.stageList.includes(st.id)) sim.stageList = [st.id]; sim.jump(st.id, sc); } }); for (const st of all('stage')) for (const k of ['intro', 'outro', 'ending']) if (st[k]) out.push({ label: 'cutscene ' + st[k], go: () => { const sim = this.play.s.sim; if (sim.stageId !== st.id) { sim.stageList = [st.id]; sim.jump(st.id, st.scenes[0]); } sim.startCut(st[k], () => sim.startScene(0)); } }); return out; },\\n  p2bot() { const s = this.play.s, sim = s.sim; if (sim.players.length > 1) { sim.players.splice(1); s.huds.splice(1); s.aimers.splice(1); s.bots.splice(1); s.inputs.splice(1); return; } const p = sim._newPlayer({ name: 'P2', agent: 'rook', color: '#3b82f6' }, 1); sim.players.push(p); s.huds.push(new Hud(1)); s.aimers.push(null); s.inputs.push(null); s.bots.push(new TC.Autopilot('fair')); },\\n  say(m) { this.msg = m; this.msgT = 2; },\\n  adjust(it, dir, big) {\\n    if (it.kind === 'toggle') { tset(it.path, !tget(it.path)); return; }\\n    if (it.kind === 'slider') { const v = clamp(Math.round((tget(it.path) + dir * it.step * (big ? 5 : 1)) / it.step) * it.step, it.min, it.max); tset(it.path, +v.toFixed(4)); }\\n    if (it.kind === 'pick') { if (it.list === 'jump') this.jumpI = (this.jumpI + dir + this.jumps().length) % this.jumps().length; else this.spawnI = Math.max(0, this.spawnI + dir); }\\n  },\\n  update(dt) {\\n    const I = game.input, items = this.items(); this.msgT = Math.max(0, this.msgT - dt);\\n    if (I.pressed('pause') || (I.pressed('cancel') && !this.confirm)) { this.close(); I.consumeAll(); return; }\\n    if (I.pressed('tab') || I.pressed('prev')) { this.tab = (this.tab + DEVT.length - 1) % DEVT.length; this.i = 0; }\\n    if (I.pressed('tabR') || I.pressed('next')) { this.tab = (this.tab + 1) % DEVT.length; this.i = 0; }\\n    if (I.repeat('down', .3, .08)) { this.i = (this.i + 1) % items.length; this.confirm = false; } if (I.repeat('up', .3, .08)) { this.i = (this.i + items.length - 1) % items.length; this.confirm = false; }\\n    const it = items[this.i];\\n    if (I.repeat('right', .3, .05)) this.adjust(it, 1, I.down('cover')); if (I.repeat('left', .3, .05)) this.adjust(it, -1, I.down('cover'));\\n    const ptr = I.pointer && I.pointer();\\n    if (ptr) { const k = this.rects.findIndex(q => ptr[0] >= q[0] && ptr[0] < q[0] + q[2] && ptr[1] >= q[1] && ptr[1] < q[1] + q[3]); if (k >= 0 && (!this.lp || this.lp[0] !== ptr[0] || this.lp[1] !== ptr[1])) this.i = k; this.lp = ptr.slice(); }\\n    if (ptr && I.down('fire') && items[this.i].kind === 'slider' && this.knob) { const s = items[this.i], k = clamp((ptr[0] - this.knob[0]) / this.knob[1], 0, 1); tset(s.path, +(Math.round(lerp(s.min, s.max, k) / s.step) * s.step).toFixed(4)); }\\n    if (I.pressed('next') && false) return;\\n    if (I.pressed('reset') && it.path) { tset(it.path, it.path.split('.').reduce((o, k) => o[k], TUNE)); }\\n    const tabHit = I.clicked && I.clicked() && this.tabRects ? this.tabRects.findIndex(q => I.clicked()[0] >= q[0] && I.clicked()[0] < q[0] + q[2] && I.clicked()[1] >= q[1] && I.clicked()[1] < q[1] + q[3]) : -1;\\n    if (tabHit >= 0) { this.tab = tabHit; this.i = 0; return; }\\n    if (I.pressed('confirm') || (I.clicked && I.clicked() && it.kind !== 'slider')) {\\n      if (it.kind === 'reset') { if (this.confirm) { TC.resetTune(); this.confirm = false; this.say('All values reset to defaults'); } else this.confirm = true; }\\n      else if (it.kind === 'toggle') this.adjust(it, 1);\\n      else if (it.run) { it.run(); this.say(it.label + ' ✓'); }\\n    }\\n    this.play.s.sim.cheats.god = !!tune.player.god;\\n  },\\n  draw(g, r) {\\n    const items = this.items(), w = Math.min(r.W - 20, 300), x = (r.W - w) / 2, y = 14, h = r.H - 28;\\n    E.ui.box(g, x, y, w, h, { bg: ['#0a1a34', '#040a18'], border: UI.gold, alpha: .96 });\\n    T(g, 'DEV MODE', x + 6, y + 4, UI.gold); T(g, '[' + TC.label(game.input, 'prev') + '/' + TC.label(game.input, 'next') + '] TAB', x + w - 6, y + 4, UI.dim, { align: 'right', font: 'tiny' });\\n    this.tabRects = []; let tx = x + 6; DEVT.forEach(([name], k) => { const tw = TW(name, { font: 'tiny' }) + 8; this.tabRects.push([tx, y + 14, tw, 10]); E.px.rect(g, tx, y + 14, tw, 10, k === this.tab ? '#2a5aa0' : '#10244a'); T(g, name, tx + 4, y + 16, k === this.tab ? '#ffffff' : '#8aa0c8', { font: 'tiny' }); tx += tw + 2; });\\n    const rowH = 11, top = y + 30, vis = Math.floor((h - 46) / rowH), off = Math.max(0, Math.min(this.i - vis + 2, items.length - vis));\\n    this.rects = []; this.knob = null;\\n    items.forEach((it, k) => {\\n      const yy = top + (k - off) * rowH; this.rects.push([x + 4, yy - 1, w - 8, rowH]); if (k < off || k >= off + vis) return;\\n      const on = k === this.i; if (on) E.px.rect(g, x + 4, yy - 1, w - 8, rowH, '#1e3e70');\\n      if (it.kind === 'reset') { T(g, this.confirm && on ? 'PRESS AGAIN TO RESET EVERYTHING' : it.label, x + w / 2, yy, this.confirm && on ? UI.warn : UI.gold, { align: 'center' }); return; }\\n      T(g, it.label, x + 8, yy, on ? '#ffffff' : '#b8c8e8');\\n      if (it.path) { const v = tget(it.path), d = it.path.split('.').reduce((o, q) => o[q], TUNE), changed = v !== d, col = changed ? UI.gold : '#ffffff';\\n        if (it.kind === 'toggle') T(g, v ? 'ON' : 'OFF', x + w - 8, yy, col, { align: 'right' });\\n        else { const bx = x + w - 118, bw = 70, k2 = (v - it.min) / (it.max - it.min); E.px.rect(g, bx, yy + 3, bw, 2, '#3a4a6a'); E.px.rect(g, bx + k2 * bw - 1, yy, 3, 8, col); if (on) this.knob = [bx, bw]; T(g, +v.toFixed(2), x + w - 8, yy, col, { align: 'right' }); }\\n        if (changed) T(g, '(' + d + ')', x + w - 124 - (it.kind === 'toggle' ? -40 : 0), yy, '#5a6078', { align: 'right', font: 'tiny' }); }\\n      if (it.kind === 'pick' && on) T(g, '◂ ▸', x + w - 8, yy, UI.dim, { align: 'right' });\\n    });\\n    if (this.msgT > 0) T(g, this.msg, r.W / 2, y + h - 22, '#8aff8a', { align: 'center' });\\n    T(g, '[' + TC.label(game.input, 'confirm') + '] RUN/TOGGLE  [◂ ▸] ADJUST  [' + TC.label(game.input, 'reset') + '] RESET ONE  [' + TC.label(game.input, 'cancel') + '] CLOSE', r.W / 2, y + h - 10, UI.dim, { align: 'center', font: 'tiny' });\\n  }\\n};\\nTC.dev = Dev;\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[],\"originalFile\":null,\"userModified\":false},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01GZQkK34QTFRutfdybcnbpB\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":50,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f\",\"uuid\":\"9bcc4386-916d-4d40-9fb3-acec22c5a234\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":200,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f\",\"uuid\":\"60b19410-7976-406f-ab07-e670d1077aa8\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":350,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f\",\"uuid\":\"4dc70e0d-64f6-4dca-9ac2-a549c31a46dc\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183009/engine/CHANGES.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":8,"oldLines":3,"newStart":8,"newLines":11,"lines":[" 2. **Stereo pan for sound effects** (`audio.sfx(voice, { pan: -1..1 })`). A `StereoPannerNode` per call between the","    voices and the effects bus, so gunfire, rotors and explosions sit left or right of the screen. Without `pan` nothing","    changes.","+3. **PlayStation glyphs by default** (the standard `glyphs` setting). The task designs for a DualSense first, with an","+   Xbox option: the setting now defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation and Xbox only, and applies to every","+   local player's input.","+4. **Settings rows on any Shell screen** (`shell.show(name, { rows: [[heading, [keys]]] })`). A screen of the game's own","+   can list settings rows (sliders, toggles, selects) drawn by the Shell's own `_row`, with pad, key and mouse focus: the","+   dev screen's live sliders are settings in a group of their own.","+5. **Hidden setting groups** (`E.Shell.hiddenGroups = ['Dev']`). The standard Settings screen skips those groups, so the","+   dev sliders live in `game.settings` (saved, checked, reset by `settings.reset('Dev')`) without crowding Settings."]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183009__xe162c9/work/OperationWolfpack-OperationWolf-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183009/engine/my-3d2dge.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":2996,"oldLines":7,"newStart":2996,"newLines":7,"lines":["   bindings: { group: 'Controls', type: 'bindings', value: () => ({}), apply: (g, v) => { g.input.bindings = v; } },","   deadzone: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Stick dead zone', type: 'slider', value: .18, min: .05, max: .5, step: .01, apply: (g, v) => { g.input.deadzone = v; } },","   invertY: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Invert aim up and down', type: 'toggle', value: false, apply: (g, v) => { g.input.invertAimY = !!v; } },","-  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Auto'], ['xbox', 'Xbox'], ['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['nintendo', 'Nintendo'], ['generic', 'Positions']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; } },","+  glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'playstation', options: [['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['xbox', 'Xbox']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; for (const q of g._players || []) q.glyphs = v; } },","   rumble: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Vibration', type: 'slider', value: .6, apply: (g, v) => { g.input.rumbleScale = v; } },","   touch: { group: 'Touch', label: 'Touch buttons', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Automatic'], ['on', 'Always'], ['off', 'Hidden']], apply: g => g.input._touchSync() },","   hand: { group: 'Touch', label: 'Buttons on', type: 'select', value: 'right', options: [['right', 'Right'], ['left', 'Left']], apply: g => g.input._touchSync() },"]},{"oldStart":9375,"oldLines":7,"newStart":9375,"newLines":7,"lines":["   _settingsRows(add) {","     const S = this._game.settings, own = this._items().map(i => i.key);","     if (!this._std) { for (const k of own) add(this._row(k)); return; }","-    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g)));","+    const groups = SHELL_GROUPS.concat([...new Set(S.keys().map(k => S.spec(k).group))].filter(g => !SHELL_GROUPS.includes(g) && !['Controls', 'Controller', 'Touch'].includes(g) && !(Shell.hiddenGroups || []).includes(g)));","     for (const g of groups) {","       const keys = S.keys(g).filter(k => (k !== 'scale' || this._game.screen._fixedRes()) && (k !== 'fullscreen' || this._game.o.fullscreen !== false) && (k !== 'zoom' || !this._game._zoomStd() || this._game._zooms()) && S.spec(k).type !== 'value');","       if (!keys.length) continue;"]},{"oldStart":9461,"oldLines":6,"newStart":9461,"newLines":7,"lines":["     add(v(s.text) && this._el('p', title ? '' : 'esh-m', v(s.text)));","     if (name === 'settings') this._settingsRows(add);","     if (name === 'controls') this._controls(add);","+    if (s.rows) for (const [h, keys] of v(s.rows)) { if (h) add(this._el('div', 'esh-k esh-sec', h)); for (const k of keys) add(this._row(k)); }   // a screen of settings rows of the game's own (a dev screen)","     if (s.keys) { const g = this._el('div', 'esh-grid'); for (const [k, w] of v(s.keys)) g.append(this._el('kbd', '', k), this._el('span', '', w)); add(g); }","     for (const [h, t] of v(s.sections) || []) add(this._el('div', 'esh-k esh-sec', h), this._el('p', 'esh-m', t));","     if (s.stats) { const g = this._el('div', 'esh-stats'); for (const [val, lab] of v(s.stats)) { const c = this._el('div'); c.append(this._el('b', '', val), this._el('small', '', lab)); g.appendChild(c); } add(g); }"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183153__xf5fb84/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":923,"oldLines":3,"newStart":923,"newLines":4,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":150,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a\",\"uuid\":\"c90f0d80-606e-4160-8cd7-b79536a7262a\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":300,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a\",\"uuid\":\"ed607cc0-d202-4e8f-bbcf-043f4f7dc8ba\"}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":400,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a\",\"uuid\":\"3e6f1d7c-2ebb-4cd7-9dbd-160cfc193f23\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":550,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":150,\"session_id\":\"fcbe5b02-218b-4276-a1cd-eeebf017e39a\",\"uuid\":\"c08d2113-2c0b-46c8-8d59-70b341a20383\"}"]}]},{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/agent.out","hunks":[{"oldStart":865,"oldLines":3,"newStart":865,"newLines":5,"lines":[" {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":1150,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":100,\"session_id\":\"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654\",\"uuid\":\"b28181bf-a0d6-4a2c-963d-f3ce8800f1b0\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh5SehJfoEdvfkyPrQtu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":11381,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":526898,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":11381},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654\",\"uuid\":\"e7fcc32c-8a8b-41e5-b619-1ad0c95afd4f\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:12:12.159Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh5SeRgYkDkKfSoKNz8Y\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":11323,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh5SehJfoEdvfkyPrQtu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now scoring, ranks, unlocks and saves.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":11381,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":526898,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":11381},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654\",\"uuid\":\"5d58e645-62e2-4884-8110-1ece9b5a8d82\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:12:12.161Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh5SeRgYkDkKfSoKNz8Y\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh5SehJfoEdvfkyPrQtu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01SA6nF2noVN2akGvDQ7VDAN\",\"name\":\"Write\",\"input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/work/Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331/src/61-score.js\",\"content\":\"/* ---- SCORE, RANKS, UNLOCKS, SAVES. The bus counts what happened; the formula turns it into a score; bento grades are\\n * the ranks; high ranks unlock tools; the save keeps the story's progress, best ranks and the Shadow Trial's board ---- */\\nconst RANKS = [[2600, 'Grand Kaiseki', 'GK'], [2000, 'Makunouchi', 'M'], [1400, 'Ekiben', 'E'], [800, 'Hinomaru', 'H'], [-1e9, 'Leftovers', 'L']];\\nconst RANK_ORDER = RANKS.map(r => r[1]);\\nconst Score = {};\\nB.on('silentCut', e => { const M = B.M; if (!M) return; M.stats.silentCuts++; M.stats.cutKinds[e.kind] = (M.stats.cutKinds[e.kind] || 0) + 1; if (e.victim.kind === 'civ' && !e.victim.disguised) M.stats.civiliansHarmed++; });\\nB.on('kill', e => { const M = B.M; if (!M || e.how === 'cut') return; if (e.victim.kind === 'boss' || e.victim.kind === 'spirit') return; M.stats.kills++; if (e.how === 'poison') M.stats.cleanKills++; if (e.victim.kind === 'civ' && !e.victim.harmed && !e.victim.target) { e.victim.harmed = 1; M.stats.civiliansHarmed++; } });\\nB.on('toolUsed', () => { if (B.M) B.M.stats.toolsUsed++; });\\nB.on('mark', () => { if (B.M) B.M.stats.marks++; });\\n/** the story score of a finished mission */\\nScore.story = (M, par) => {\\n  const s = M.stats, parT = (par || 600) * T('parTimeMul'), other = s.kills;\\n  const parts = [['Mission complete', 1000], ['Silent Cuts', 150 * s.silentCuts], ['Other kills', 25 * other], ['Clean kills', 100 * s.cleanKills], ['Optional tasks', 300 * s.optionalDone],\\n    ['Detections', -150 * s.detections], ['Unseen', s.detections === 0 ? 400 : 0], ['Civilians harmed', -400 * s.civiliansHarmed], ['Retries', -200 * s.retries],\\n    ['Untouched', s.damageTaken < .5 ? 200 : 0], ['Time bonus', Math.round(Math.min(500, Math.max(0, parT - s.time)))]];\\n  return { total: parts.reduce((a, p) => a + p[1], 0), parts };\\n};\\nScore.rank = sc => RANKS.find(r => sc >= r[0]);\\nScore.rankAtLeast = (have, need) => RANK_ORDER.indexOf(have) >= 0 && RANK_ORDER.indexOf(have) <= RANK_ORDER.indexOf(need);\\n/** the trial / hub round's score (the same rules alone and in a session) */\\nScore.round = (M, o = {}) => {\\n  const s = M.stats, target = M.level.target ? Mission.find(M, M.level.target) : null, down = target && !target.alive;\\n  let sc = (down ? 2000 : 0) + (o.escaped && down ? 1000 : 0) + 250 * s.silentCuts + 50 * s.kills + (s.detections === 0 ? 600 : -150 * s.detections) - 500 * s.civiliansHarmed;\\n  if (o.escaped) sc += Math.min(1200, Math.max(0, Math.round(4 * (300 - s.time))));\\n  return Math.max(0, Math.round(sc));\\n};\\n/** unlocks earned by a mission's rank: [tool ids] */\\nScore.unlocks = (missionId, rank, save) => {\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (const id of TOOL_ORDER) {\\n    const t = B.get('tool', id); if (!t.unlock || save.tools.includes(id)) continue;\\n    if ((t.unlock.mission === missionId || t.unlock.mission === 'any') && Score.rankAtLeast(rank, t.unlock.rank)) out.push(id);\\n  }\\n  return out;\\n};\\n/* ---- THE SAVE: game.saves (three slots and the autosave); a hub session never writes ---- */\\nconst Save = { data: null };\\nSave.fresh = (char = 'sojiro') => ({ v: 1, character: char, nextMission: 'training', completed: {}, best: {}, tools: [], lastLoadout: {}, flags: {}, playSeconds: 0, story: false });\\nSave.get = () => Save.data || (Save.data = Save.fresh());\\nconst MISSION_NAMES = { training: 'The Trial of the Second Tier', m1: 'Rice and Ash', m2: 'The Fort at Kiri Lake', m3: 'Moon over Kokaku', ending: 'Fed by All' };\\ngame.saves.write = () => { const d = Save.get(); return { data: d, place: MISSION_NAMES[d.nextMission] || 'The Jubako-ya', level: (B.CHARS[d.character] || B.CHARS.sojiro).name }; };\\ngame.saves.read = s => { Save.data = Object.assign(Save.fresh(), s.data || {}); };\\nSave.write = () => { if (HUBACTIVE || (B.M && B.M.mode === 'attract')) return false; try { return game.saves.save('auto'); } catch (e) { return false; } };\\nSave.record = (missionId, char, sc, rank) => {\\n  const d = Save.get(); d.completed[missionId] = true;\\n  const b = (d.best[missionId] = d.best[missionId] || {}), old = b[char];\\n  if (!old || sc > old.score) b[char] = { score: sc, rank };\\n  const un = Score.unlocks(missionId, rank, d); for (const t of un) d.tools.push(t);\\n  return un;\\n};\\n/** the Shadow Trial's board: the top 5 runs, and the best one's ghost (10 samples a second) */\\nSave.trial = () => E.store.get('bentou:trial', { board: [], ghost: null });\\nSave.trialAdd = (entry, track) => {\\n  if (HUBACTIVE) return 0;\\n  const t = Save.trial(); t.board.push(entry); t.board.sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score); const place = t.board.indexOf(entry) + 1; t.board = t.board.slice(0, 5);\\n  if (place === 1 && track && track.length) t.ghost = { score: entry.score, char: entry.char, track };\\n  E.store.set('bentou:trial', t); return place;\\n};\\nB.Score = Score; B.Save = Save; B.RANKS = RANKS; B.MISSION_NAMES = MISSION_NAMES;\\n\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":11381,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":526898,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":11381},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654\",\"uuid\":\"7a0433cb-1340-408d-8e15-6ab3c75ca553\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:12:32.390Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh5SeRgYkDkKfSoKNz8Y\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01SA6nF2noVN2akGvDQ7VDAN\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/work/Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331/src/61-score.js\",\"content\":\"/* ---- SCORE, RANKS, UNLOCKS, SAVES. The bus counts what happened; the formula turns it into a score; bento grades are\\n * the ranks; high ranks unlock tools; the save keeps the story's progress, best ranks and the Shadow Trial's board ---- */\\nconst RANKS = [[2600, 'Grand Kaiseki', 'GK'], [2000, 'Makunouchi', 'M'], [1400, 'Ekiben', 'E'], [800, 'Hinomaru', 'H'], [-1e9, 'Leftovers', 'L']];\\nconst RANK_ORDER = RANKS.map(r => r[1]);\\nconst Score = {};\\nB.on('silentCut', e => { const M = B.M; if (!M) return; M.stats.silentCuts++; M.stats.cutKinds[e.kind] = (M.stats.cutKinds[e.kind] || 0) + 1; if (e.victim.kind === 'civ' && !e.victim.disguised) M.stats.civiliansHarmed++; });\\nB.on('kill', e => { const M = B.M; if (!M || e.how === 'cut') return; if (e.victim.kind === 'boss' || e.victim.kind === 'spirit') return; M.stats.kills++; if (e.how === 'poison') M.stats.cleanKills++; if (e.victim.kind === 'civ' && !e.victim.harmed && !e.victim.target) { e.victim.harmed = 1; M.stats.civiliansHarmed++; } });\\nB.on('toolUsed', () => { if (B.M) B.M.stats.toolsUsed++; });\\nB.on('mark', () => { if (B.M) B.M.stats.marks++; });\\n/** the story score of a finished mission */\\nScore.story = (M, par) => {\\n  const s = M.stats, parT = (par || 600) * T('parTimeMul'), other = s.kills;\\n  const parts = [['Mission complete', 1000], ['Silent Cuts', 150 * s.silentCuts], ['Other kills', 25 * other], ['Clean kills', 100 * s.cleanKills], ['Optional tasks', 300 * s.optionalDone],\\n    ['Detections', -150 * s.detections], ['Unseen', s.detections === 0 ? 400 : 0], ['Civilians harmed', -400 * s.civiliansHarmed], ['Retries', -200 * s.retries],\\n    ['Untouched', s.damageTaken < .5 ? 200 : 0], ['Time bonus', Math.round(Math.min(500, Math.max(0, parT - s.time)))]];\\n  return { total: parts.reduce((a, p) => a + p[1], 0), parts };\\n};\\nScore.rank = sc => RANKS.find(r => sc >= r[0]);\\nScore.rankAtLeast = (have, need) => RANK_ORDER.indexOf(have) >= 0 && RANK_ORDER.indexOf(have) <= RANK_ORDER.indexOf(need);\\n/** the trial / hub round's score (the same rules alone and in a session) */\\nScore.round = (M, o = {}) => {\\n  const s = M.stats, target = M.level.target ? Mission.find(M, M.level.target) : null, down = target && !target.alive;\\n  let sc = (down ? 2000 : 0) + (o.escaped && down ? 1000 : 0) + 250 * s.silentCuts + 50 * s.kills + (s.detections === 0 ? 600 : -150 * s.detections) - 500 * s.civiliansHarmed;\\n  if (o.escaped) sc += Math.min(1200, Math.max(0, Math.round(4 * (300 - s.time))));\\n  return Math.max(0, Math.round(sc));\\n};\\n/** unlocks earned by a mission's rank: [tool ids] */\\nScore.unlocks = (missionId, rank, save) => {\\n  const out = [];\\n  for (const id of TOOL_ORDER) {\\n    const t = B.get('tool', id); if (!t.unlock || save.tools.includes(id)) continue;\\n    if ((t.unlock.mission === missionId || t.unlock.mission === 'any') && Score.rankAtLeast(rank, t.unlock.rank)) out.push(id);\\n  }\\n  return out;\\n};\\n/* ---- THE SAVE: game.saves (three slots and the autosave); a hub session never writes ---- */\\nconst Save = { data: null };\\nSave.fresh = (char = 'sojiro') => ({ v: 1, character: char, nextMission: 'training', completed: {}, best: {}, tools: [], lastLoadout: {}, flags: {}, playSeconds: 0, story: false });\\nSave.get = () => Save.data || (Save.data = Save.fresh());\\nconst MISSION_NAMES = { training: 'The Trial of the Second Tier', m1: 'Rice and Ash', m2: 'The Fort at Kiri Lake', m3: 'Moon over Kokaku', ending: 'Fed by All' };\\ngame.saves.write = () => { const d = Save.get(); return { data: d, place: MISSION_NAMES[d.nextMission] || 'The Jubako-ya', level: (B.CHARS[d.character] || B.CHARS.sojiro).name }; };\\ngame.saves.read = s => { Save.data = Object.assign(Save.fresh(), s.data || {}); };\\nSave.write = () => { if (HUBACTIVE || (B.M && B.M.mode === 'attract')) return false; try { return game.saves.save('auto'); } catch (e) { return false; } };\\nSave.record = (missionId, char, sc, rank) => {\\n  const d = Save.get(); d.completed[missionId] = true;\\n  const b = (d.best[missionId] = d.best[missionId] || {}), old = b[char];\\n  if (!old || sc > old.score) b[char] = { score: sc, rank };\\n  const un = Score.unlocks(missionId, rank, d); for (const t of un) d.tools.push(t);\\n  return un;\\n};\\n/** the Shadow Trial's board: the top 5 runs, and the best one's ghost (10 samples a second) */\\nSave.trial = () => E.store.get('bentou:trial', { board: [], ghost: null });\\nSave.trialAdd = (entry, track) => {\\n  if (HUBACTIVE) return 0;\\n  const t = Save.trial(); t.board.push(entry); t.board.sort((a, b) => b.score - a.score); const place = t.board.indexOf(entry) + 1; t.board = t.board.slice(0, 5);\\n  if (place === 1 && track && track.length) t.ghost = { score: entry.score, char: entry.char, track };\\n  E.store.set('bentou:trial', t); return place;\\n};\\nB.Score = Score; B.Save = Save; B.RANKS = RANKS; B.MISSION_NAMES = MISSION_NAMES;\\n\"}}}","+{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01SA6nF2noVN2akGvDQ7VDAN\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"File created successfully at: /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-183331__xf7f297/work/Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-183331/src/61-score.js (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"58a16430-39e5-4d69-a4e7-fa8db44e4654\",\"uu