"2026-11-04T02:20:19.770Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh64xW7rWYwnKqJgLFxf\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":12101,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}"," {\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh64xrhvzkf4RBCWtaGS\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The hook is correct that I should keep working rather than hand back the same status. You asked for the whole goal, and the remaining PLAN.md items are concrete, so I'll build the ones that are still missing. I'll start with the captor's hostage and the jet-ski's ski explosion, then the drone and ski meshes, the boat deck under the rail ride, and the entry animations.\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":4,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2039,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":552226,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2039},\"output_tokens\":8,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2\",\"uuid\":\"491a9234-c37d-4322-bb7b-eddd82715ae6\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:20:20.427Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh64xW7rWYwnKqJgLFxf\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cgh64xrhvzkf4RBCWtaGS\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01KpM4jftLxktXz6agEbtvbh\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\\ndef edit(p, pairs):\\n    s=open(p).read()\\n    for old,new in pairs:\\n        n=s.count(old); assert n==1,(p,n,old[:80]); s=s.replace(old,new)\\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\\n\\n# Captor hostage: a hostage volume beside the captor. Shooting the hostage costs a life and 5,000 points.\\nedit('src/04-sim.js', [\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (e.def && e.def.headOnly) return [head];\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (e.def && e.def.headOnly) {\\n      // The captor's hostage stands beside it: a shot at the hostage costs a life (plan 5.3).\\n      return [head, { part: 'hostage', b: [x + 8 * s - 3 * s, y - 3 * s, z, x + 8 * s + 3 * s, y + 3 * s, z + 20 * s] }];\\n    }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"      case 'enemy': {\\n        const e = best.enemy;\\n        const head = best.part === 'head';\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"      case 'enemy': {\\n        const e = best.enemy;\\n        if (best.part === 'hostage') {\\n          p.stats.hits++;\\n          this.hitCivilian(e, p, at, true);\\n          return true;\\n        }\\n        const head = best.part === 'head';\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"  hitCivilian(e, p, at) {\\n    e.hp = 0; e.alive = false; e.dead = true; e.deathT = 0; e.deathWhy = 'civ';\\n    p.stats.civ++;\\n    this.addScore(p, -5000, at);\\n    this.loseLife(p, 'civilian', true);\\n    this.emit('civilian', { player: p.id, at });\\n  }\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"  // A civilian (or a hostage) is hit: the penalty is the same. A captor's hostage is hit alive: the captor stays.\\n  hitCivilian(e, p, at, hostage = false) {\\n    if (!hostage) { e.hp = 0; e.alive = false; e.dead = true; e.deathT = 0; e.deathWhy = 'civ'; }\\n    p.stats.civ++;\\n    this.addScore(p, -5000, at);\\n    this.loseLife(p, hostage ? 'hostage' : 'civilian', true);\\n    this.emit('civilian', { player: p.id, at, hostage });\\n  }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (def.drop) this.dropAmmo(e, p, at);\\\"\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (def.drop) this.dropAmmo(e, p, at);\\n    // A jet-ski's fuel tank goes up with the rider: a bonus for the shooter and an area blast (plan 5.3).\\n    if (def.ski) { this.addScore(p, 1000, at); this.explode(e.x, e.y, 6, 40, 8, p); }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n])\\nedit('src/03-enemies.js', [\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"  name: 'Jet-ski rider', hp: 1, tele: 1.0, threat: 'chance', kind: 'pistol', every: 2.2, speed: 60, burst: [1, 1], gap: 0,\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"  name: 'Jet-ski rider', hp: 1, tele: 1.0, threat: 'chance', kind: 'pistol', every: 2.2, speed: 60, burst: [1, 1], gap: 0, ski: true,\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n])\\nprint('sim ok')\\nEOF\\ngrep -n \\\"hitCivilian(e, p, at)\\\" src/*.js | head -3\",\"description\":\"Add captor hostage penalty and jet-ski explosion\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":4,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2039,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":552226,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2039},\"output_tokens\":8,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"a4347fe7-6622-4d1f-b2e4-5b62026e02e2\",\"uuid\":\"754d8a37-3700-451c-b155-05b817cd3fb4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T02:20:24.881Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011Cgh64xW7rWYwnKqJgLFxf\",\"wire_tool_inputs\":{\"toolu_01KpM4jftLxktXz6agEbtvbh\":{\"command\":\"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183312__xf5fb84/work/SublimeCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261103-183312 && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\\ndef edit(p, pairs):\\n    s=open(p).read()\\n    for old,new in pairs:\\n        n=s.count(old); assert n==1,(p,n,old[:80]); s=s.replace(old,new)\\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\\n\\n# Captor hostage: a hostage volume beside the captor. Shooting the hostage costs a life and 5,000 points.\\nedit('src/04-sim.js', [\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (e.def && e.def.headOnly) return [head];\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (e.def && e.def.headOnly) {\\n      // The captor's hostage stands beside it: a shot at the hostage costs a life (plan 5.3).\\n      return [head, { part: 'hostage', b: [x + 8 * s - 3 * s, y - 3 * s, z, x + 8 * s + 3 * s, y + 3 * s, z + 20 * s] }];\\n    }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"      case 'enemy': {\\n        const e = best.enemy;\\n        const head = best.part === 'head';\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"      case 'enemy': {\\n        const e = best.enemy;\\n        if (best.part === 'hostage') {\\n          p.stats.hits++;\\n          this.hitCivilian(e, p, at, true);\\n          return true;\\n        }\\n        const head = best.part === 'head';\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"  hitCivilian(e, p, at) {\\n    e.hp = 0; e.alive = false; e.dead = true; e.deathT = 0; e.deathWhy = 'civ';\\n    p.stats.civ++;\\n    this.addScore(p, -5000, at);\\n    this.loseLife(p, 'civilian', true);\\n    this.emit('civilian', { player: p.id, at });\\n  }\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"  // A civilian (or a hostage) is hit: the penalty is the same. A captor's hostage is hit alive: the captor stays.\\n  hitCivilian(e, p, at, hostage = false) {\\n    if (!hostage) { e.hp = 0; e.alive = false; e.dead = true; e.deathT = 0; e.deathWhy = 'civ'; }\\n    p.stats.civ++;\\n    this.addScore(p, -5000, at);\\n    this.loseLife(p, hostage ? 'hostage' : 'civilian', true);\\n    this.emit('civilian', { player: p.id, at, hostage });\\n  }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (def.drop) this.dropAmmo(e, p, at);\\\"\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"\\\"    if (def.drop) this.dropAmmo(e, p, at);\\n    // A jet-ski's fuel tank goes up with the rider: a bonus for the shooter and an area blast (plan 5.3).\\n    if (def.ski) { this.addScore(p, 1000, at); this.explode(e.x, e.y, 6, 40, 8, p); }\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n])\\nedit('src/03-enemies.js', [\\n(\\\"\\\"\\\"  name: 'Jet-ski rider', hp: 1, tele: 1.0, threat: 'chance', kind: 'pistol', every: 2.2, speed: 60, burst: [1, 1], gap: 0,\\\"\\\"\\\",\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"  name: 'Jet-ski rider', hp: 1, tele: 1.0, threat: 'chance', kind: 'pistol', every: 2.2, speed: 60, burst: [1, 1], gap: 0, ski: true,\\\"\\\"\\\"),\\n])\\nprint('sim ok')\\nEOF\\ngrep -n \\\"hitCivilian(e, p, at)\\\" src/*.js | head -3\",\"descripti